    "detailed_description": "<h1>Playtest round 2</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather your crew and join the ongoing playtest right now!</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traitors is a social deduction shooter for 4-12 players set in a procedurally generated, alien infested space station, where the environment changes every round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Crewmates will try to repair the station's communication equipment and call for evacuation, while the outnumbered Traitors will use special tools to stop that from happening. Whatever your role, work fast, because the oxygen is running low!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/feb910c6931e3a15b9f6e26fd12077be.avif?t=1754570894\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/dd2e4077048bfd4f646ee5116d2f76f7.poster.avif?t=1754570894\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/dd2e4077048bfd4f646ee5116d2f76f7.webm?t=1754570894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/dd2e4077048bfd4f646ee5116d2f76f7.mp4?t=1754570894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traitors is a game about exploration and looting. The game always starts at the Hangar, where the map potentially branches out to three wings. Rest of the rooms are chosen at random. Some rooms have unique properties, like vending machines, electrical controls or environmental dangers that Traitors can leverage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the locked door to Communications Room using a GPS, a map or pure luck. Craft the correct keycard at the office in Hangar using resin and the code on the locked door. Repair the communications equipment using the required items, push the red button and hurry back to the Hangar, a rescue ship is arriving and it won't wait too long!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map scales in size as the player count increases.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/a1bf4019edaca8080f9a518ca9666d4b.avif?t=1754570894\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/4355127961303d8aef98a0c37f174c2e.poster.avif?t=1754570894\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/4355127961303d8aef98a0c37f174c2e.webm?t=1754570894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/4355127961303d8aef98a0c37f174c2e.mp4?t=1754570894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up! Avoid the bigger monsters until you have access to firearms and ammo. Sounds attract enemies, so move slow and stay quiet when moving past them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/e25b76c8a71580267099b2991e26032c.avif?t=1754570894\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/3789972b09f929c306342e79c005d299.poster.avif?t=1754570894\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/3789972b09f929c306342e79c005d299.webm?t=1754570894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/3789972b09f929c306342e79c005d299.mp4?t=1754570894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive proximity chat makes everyone sound like they are part of the world. Player voices, gunshots and other audible actions get occluded behind walls and solid objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/8ce4ba41dcfa317d274c95d2f71a3bd2.avif?t=1754570894\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pistols, rifles, shotguns, melee weapons and grenade launchers. Firearms and valuable equipment can be found in locked safes. Find a key first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cash from containers, deposit it using a Deposit Machine and use Terminals to order equipment such as Teleport tablets, GPSs, Flashlights, Keys, Oxygen, Medkits and Ammo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traitors may use credits to purchase special equipment with instant delivery. This includes time bombs, daggers, disguisers, cleaning kits, mines and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/533d920a0430d77fc71fe1b18b3d3592.avif?t=1754570894\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/09cf94f1ece2085831f59ae2066e623b.poster.avif?t=1754570894\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/09cf94f1ece2085831f59ae2066e623b.webm?t=1754570894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/09cf94f1ece2085831f59ae2066e623b.mp4?t=1754570894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The spectate UI makes it easy to follow the action even when the map get big. Two different camera modes allow you to easily sit back and spectate or frame your own cinematic shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/65ee4a1115e9a2ea2b0b9be02977accc.avif?t=1754570894\" width=616 height=100 /></span>Hosts can customize the match settings, including the roles, loot and procedural generation rules. Let us know if there's a setting you'd like to see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A breakdown of key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-12 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated map with 20 unique rooms to get lost in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity chat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A percentage of players will be Traitors, trying to kill rest of the Crewmates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psycho Killer and Sheriff roles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map, objective count and loot scale with player count.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters and other hazards that attack and harm all players regardless of teams.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain access to the Communications room and firearms by 3D printing keycards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call for evacuation by repairing the station's radio equipment. The items needed for the repairs will be scattered around the station.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refill your personal oxygen tank at the Oxygen Generator in hangar. When the generator eventually runs out of power, you will have to find or purchase more oxygen to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hosts can customize the server rules, ranging from role and round specific to procedural generation settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does not feature a text chat, requires a microphone to play!<br><br>Join our Discord!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traitors is a social deduction shooter for 4-12 players set in a procedurally generated, alien infested space station, where the environment changes every round.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The Crewmates will try to repair the station's communication equipment and call for evacuation, while the outnumbered Traitors will use special tools to stop that from happening. Whatever your role, work fast, because the oxygen is running low!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/feb910c6931e3a15b9f6e26fd12077be.avif?t=1754570894\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/dd2e4077048bfd4f646ee5116d2f76f7.poster.avif?t=1754570894\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/dd2e4077048bfd4f646ee5116d2f76f7.webm?t=1754570894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/dd2e4077048bfd4f646ee5116d2f76f7.mp4?t=1754570894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traitors is a game about exploration and looting. The game always starts at the Hangar, where the map potentially branches out to three wings. Rest of the rooms are chosen at random. Some rooms have unique properties, like vending machines, electrical controls or environmental dangers that Traitors can leverage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the locked door to Communications Room using a GPS, a map or pure luck. Craft the correct keycard at the office in Hangar using resin and the code on the locked door. Repair the communications equipment using the required items, push the red button and hurry back to the Hangar, a rescue ship is arriving and it won't wait too long!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map scales in size as the player count increases.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/a1bf4019edaca8080f9a518ca9666d4b.avif?t=1754570894\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/4355127961303d8aef98a0c37f174c2e.poster.avif?t=1754570894\" width=800 height=234 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/4355127961303d8aef98a0c37f174c2e.webm?t=1754570894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/4355127961303d8aef98a0c37f174c2e.mp4?t=1754570894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gear up! Avoid the bigger monsters until you have access to firearms and ammo. Sounds attract enemies, so move slow and stay quiet when moving past them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/e25b76c8a71580267099b2991e26032c.avif?t=1754570894\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/3789972b09f929c306342e79c005d299.poster.avif?t=1754570894\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/3789972b09f929c306342e79c005d299.webm?t=1754570894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/3789972b09f929c306342e79c005d299.mp4?t=1754570894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive proximity chat makes everyone sound like they are part of the world. Player voices, gunshots and other audible actions get occluded behind walls and solid objects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/8ce4ba41dcfa317d274c95d2f71a3bd2.avif?t=1754570894\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pistols, rifles, shotguns, melee weapons and grenade launchers. Firearms and valuable equipment can be found in locked safes. Find a key first!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cash from containers, deposit it using a Deposit Machine and use Terminals to order equipment such as Teleport tablets, GPSs, Flashlights, Keys, Oxygen, Medkits and Ammo.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Traitors may use credits to purchase special equipment with instant delivery. This includes time bombs, daggers, disguisers, cleaning kits, mines and more!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/533d920a0430d77fc71fe1b18b3d3592.avif?t=1754570894\" width=616 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/09cf94f1ece2085831f59ae2066e623b.poster.avif?t=1754570894\" width=800 height=232 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/09cf94f1ece2085831f59ae2066e623b.webm?t=1754570894\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/09cf94f1ece2085831f59ae2066e623b.mp4?t=1754570894\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The spectate UI makes it easy to follow the action even when the map get big. Two different camera modes allow you to easily sit back and spectate or frame your own cinematic shots.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2891790/extras/65ee4a1115e9a2ea2b0b9be02977accc.avif?t=1754570894\" width=616 height=100 /></span>Hosts can customize the match settings, including the roles, loot and procedural generation rules. Let us know if there's a setting you'd like to see.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A breakdown of key features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4-12 players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedurally generated map with 20 unique rooms to get lost in.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >High replayability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Proximity chat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A percentage of players will be Traitors, trying to kill rest of the Crewmates.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Psycho Killer and Sheriff roles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The map, objective count and loot scale with player count.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Monsters and other hazards that attack and harm all players regardless of teams.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gain access to the Communications room and firearms by 3D printing keycards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Call for evacuation by repairing the station's radio equipment. The items needed for the repairs will be scattered around the station.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refill your personal oxygen tank at the Oxygen Generator in hangar. When the generator eventually runs out of power, you will have to find or purchase more oxygen to stay alive.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hosts can customize the server rules, ranging from role and round specific to procedural generation settings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Does not feature a text chat, requires a microphone to play!<br><br>Join our Discord!</p>",
